'''''Trifolium lappaceum''''', the '''burdock clover''', is a species of annual herb in the family Fabaceae. They have a self-supporting growth form and compound, broad leaves.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Trifolium lappaceum L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/703411|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Trifolium lappaceum (Bur Clover) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/FABC/Trifolium_lappaceum.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

